# Force LF line endings for all text files regardless of core.autocrlf on
# Windows checkouts - this repo is almost entirely POSIX shell scripts and C
# source deployed to Linux, and CRLF line endings silently break shebangs
# (e.g. "#!/bin/sh\r" gets parsed as interpreter "/bin/sh\r", which doesn't
# exist, failing with a confusing "not found" error at exec time).
* text=auto eol=lf
